# Pairs with AtomicOnOwner. The saga starts with k1 recorded as dispatched
# though it never was - a dispatch checkpoint persisted ahead of the dispatch -
# so it commits a batch with k1 unstaged and readers see k2 post-saga beside
# k1 pre-saga.
MODULE: AtomicOnOwnerStartSkipsEntry
TARGET: AtomicOnOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the saga records an entry as dispatched before dispatching it, so the batch commits torn
PERTURBS: SagaStart

--- FIND
    /\ bound' = alias
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, pend, term, sp, spCopy, rs, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, refusals, prepped, told, dec, late, wDone, reacted, ackOn>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ bound' = alias
\* MUTATION: k1 is checkpointed as dispatched without being dispatched.
    /\ prepped' = {k1}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, pend, term, sp, spCopy, rs, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, refusals, told, dec, late, wDone, reacted, ackOn>>
--- END